    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"NotificationListenerBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>NotificationListenerBean</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "创建 `<a href=\"NotificationListenerBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>NotificationListenerBean</code></a>` 类的新实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Also provides support for associating the encapsulated\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a> with any number of\nMBeans from which it wishes to receive\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a> via the\n<a href=\"../support/NotificationListenerHolder.html#setMappedObjectNames(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>mappedObjectNames</code></a> property.",
      "translation": "此外，还支持将封装的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a> 与任意数量的 MBean 关联，以便通过 <a href=\"../support/NotificationListenerHolder.html#setMappedObjectNames(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>mappedObjectNames</code></a> 属性接收来自这些 MBean 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: This class supports Spring bean names as\n<a href=\"../support/NotificationListenerHolder.html#setMappedObjectNames(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>\"mappedObjectNames\"</code></a> as well, as alternative\nto specifying JMX object names. Note that only beans exported by the\nsame <a href=\"MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>MBeanExporter</code></a> are supported for such bean names.",
      "translation": "注意：该类还支持 Spring bean 名称作为指定 JMX 对象名称的替代方案，例如 <a href=\"../support/NotificationListenerHolder.html#setMappedObjectNames(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>\"mappedObjectNames\"</code></a>。请注意，仅支持由同一个 <a href=\"MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\"><code>MBeanExporter</code></a> 导出的 bean 使用此类 bean 名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>notificationListener</code> - the encapsulated listener",
      "translation": "<code>notificationListener</code> - 封装的监听器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows the bean instance to perform validation of its overall\nconfiguration and final initialization when all bean properties have been set.",
      "translation": "此方法允许 Bean 实例在其所有属性设置完成后，执行其整体配置验证和最终初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> after it has set all bean properties\nand satisfied <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, <code>ApplicationContextAware</code> etc.",
      "translation": "由包含的<code>BeanFactory</code>在设置所有 bean 属性并满足<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>、<code>ApplicationContextAware</code>等接口后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">InitializingBean</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
