      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\">afterPropertiesSet</a></code>` 接口中的 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">InitializingBean</a></code>`",
      "count": 1
